WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Good morning. This is the quarterly report, with the results and the next steps.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:19.000
Revenue grew across all four quarters, and the last one closed at three hundred and fifty-five thousand.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Overall we grew forty-eight percent, well above the thirty percent target we set in January.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:39.000
On the other side, three things eat too much time: data rework, approvals, and meetings with no agenda.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:49.000
So the next steps are automating the data load, shortening the approval cycle, and revisiting the weekly schedule.
